### ========================================
### CUSTOMER PORTAL API TESTS
### Customer-facing portal endpoints
### Requires: Customer Authentication
### ========================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### ========================================
### CUSTOMER AUTHENTICATION
### ========================================

### 1. CUSTOMER LOGIN
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer1@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.data.access_token}}
@customerRefreshToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.data.refresh_token}}

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "access_token": "jwt_token",
#     "refresh_token": "refresh_token",
#     "token_type": "Bearer",
#     "expires_in": 900
#   }
# }

### 2. GET CUSTOMER AUTH PROFILE
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 3. REFRESH CUSTOMER TOKEN
# @name customerRefresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{customerRefreshToken}}"
}

@newCustomerToken = {{customerRefresh.response.body.data.access_token}}

### 4. CUSTOMER LOGOUT
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### ========================================
### CUSTOMER PORTAL ENDPOINTS
### (All require CustomerAuth middleware)
### ========================================

### 5. GET CUSTOMER PORTAL PROFILE
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/portal/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "id": "uuid",
#     "name": "Customer Name",
#     "email": "customer@example.com",
#     "phone": "081234567890",
#     "service_type": "pppoe",
#     "service_username": "customer01",
#     "service_password": null,  // Hidden untuk PPPoE
#     "service_password_visible": false,
#     "status": "active"
#   }
# }

### 6. UPDATE CUSTOMER PORTAL PROFILE
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/portal/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Customer Name",
  "phone": "082345678901",
  "address": "New Address 123",
  "portal_password": "newpassword123"
}

### Note: Tidak bisa update service credentials (username/password untuk PPPoE)

### 7. GET CUSTOMER TRAFFIC
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/portal/traffic
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "service_username": "customer01",
#     "upload_bytes": 1048576000,
#     "download_bytes": 5242880000,
#     "total_bytes": 6291456000,
#     "session_duration_seconds": 3600,
#     "last_update": "2026-01-29T12:00:00Z"
#   }
# }

### 8. STREAM CUSTOMER TRAFFIC (WebSocket)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/portal/traffic/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Upgrade: websocket

### Real-time traffic updates every 2 seconds

### 9. RESET CUSTOMER SESSION
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/portal/session/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### This will:
### - Disconnect PPP/Hotspot session di MikroTik
### - Force customer to re-authenticate

### 10. GET USAGE HISTORY
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/portal/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Query params: ?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-01-31

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": [
#     {
#       "date": "2026-01-29",
#       "upload_bytes": 104857600,
#       "download_bytes": 524288000,
#       "total_bytes": 629145600
#     }
#   ]
# }

### ========================================
### ERROR CASES
### ========================================

### Login with invalid credentials (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer1@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Access portal without authentication (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/portal/profile

### Access portal with internal auth token (Should Fail)
# @name internalLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin@teknusantara.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

@internalToken = {{internalLogin.response.body.data.access_token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/portal/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{internalToken}}

### Update with invalid data (Should Fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer/portal/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "invalid-phone-format"
}

### ========================================
### SECURITY NOTES
### ========================================

### Portal menggunakan:
### - CustomerAuth middleware (beda dari InternalAuth)
### - CustomerPortalRateLimit (100 req/min per customer)
### - OriginValidation (CORS validation)
### - Separate JWT tokens untuk customer vs internal users
### - Customer tidak bisa akses internal endpoints
### - Internal users tidak bisa akses customer portal
